  abilityName: Howling Moon
  abilityDesc: 20 combo Dark attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    boosts Atk, Def, Rec and critical rate for 4 turns, spark damage restores HP
    for 4 turns, boosts spark damage for 4 turns, 100% DoT reduction for 4 turns
    & boosts max HP
